<title>FRANCE: CGIP sees profit rise, seeks to boost EPS.</title>
<headline>CGIP sees profit rise, seeks to boost EPS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of CGIP, Ernest-Antoine Selliere, said on Thursday he expected a rise in the company's 1997 pre-exceptional profit.</p>
<p>He added that the company was studying means to boost the earnings per share.</p>
</text>
